 other exercises. We will then share one of these writings or something we 
 are working on at home to receive feedback from the group.  Each writer 
 will be limited to reading 2 pages per feedback session.  Please bring your 
 preferred writing materials (paper & pen\, computer\, etc).  \n\nPlease 
 note:  Patrons arriving after 4:45pm will not be permitted to join the 
