BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261218T183000Z
DTEND:20261218T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20261218T000000Z
SUMMARY:Movie: I'll Be Home for Christmas
DESCRIPTION:Estranged from his father\, college student Jake is lured home 
 to New York for Christmas with the promise of receiving a classic Porsche 
 as a gift. When he is left in the desert in a Santa suit\, he has no ID or 
 money to help him make the journey. Meanwhile\, his girlfriend\, Allie\, 
 does not know where he is.
LOCATION:West Caldwell - Community Meeting Room\, West Caldwell Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="West Caldwell Public Library":MAILTO:programs@westcaldwell.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Movie
UID:LibCal-10340-15327197
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/15327197
